Package: drmeta
Title: Design-Robust Meta-Analysis via Variance-Function Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Subir", "Hait",
           email = "haitsubi@msu.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0004-9871-9677"))
Description: Implements Design-Robust Meta-Analysis (DR-Meta), a
    variance-function random-effects framework for meta-analysis in which
    between-study heterogeneity depends on a study-level design robustness
    index. Provides profiled restricted maximum likelihood estimation,
    study weights, heterogeneity diagnostics, influence analysis, and
    graphical tools. The framework nests classical fixed-effects and
    random-effects meta-analysis as special cases.
